    "detailed_description": "&quot;Happy Corp. has a mission to bring HAPPINESS to worlds throughout the Universe. We are confident that YOU are a catalyst in that glorious endeavor.&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHappy Corp is a capitalist dystopian arcade block breaker. Happy Corp. is a mysterious corporation operating throughout multiple universes. You work in the rehabilitation department, destroying cities and cultures that have fallen behind on payments.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is currently in development but will feature:<br />\r\n- Mechs<br />\r\n- Monsters<br />\r\n- 100 levels and 10 bosses<br />\r\n- Variety of biomes<br />\r\n- Capitalist Dystopia",
